{
  "name": "Day 62 Solution: Slack & Telegram Bots",
  "description": "A Slack Events bot that replies in-thread with an AI-generated response, and a Telegram bot that routes /start, /help, /report and free-text messages via chained IF nodes, with every interaction logged to Airtable.",
  "tags": [
    "week9",
    "real-tools",
    "slack",
    "telegram",
    "bots"
  ],
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "overview-sticky",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        140,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Day 62 Solution: Slack & Telegram Bots\n\nTwo independent bot flows: a Slack Events webhook that replies in-thread with an AI-generated answer (top), and a Telegram bot that routes `/start`, `/help`, `/report` and free-text messages through chained IF nodes (bottom, in place of a Switch node to match this repo's conventions). Every interaction on both platforms is logged to Airtable.\n\n**Credentials needed to run for real:** Slack OAuth2, Telegram Bot Token, OpenAI API key, Airtable Personal Access Token.\n\nSee DAILY_TASKS/DAY_62_Slack_Telegram_Bots.md for the full task.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 480
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "slack-flow-sticky",
      "name": "Flow 1: Slack Bot",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        140,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Slack bot\nWebhook receives the Slack event payload, AI drafts a reply, Slack posts it threaded to the original message.",
        "height": 130,
        "width": 280
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "telegram-flow-sticky",
      "name": "Flow 2: Telegram Bot",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        140,
        720
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Telegram bot\nNested IF nodes stand in for a Switch node per this repo's node-type conventions: check for a leading `/`, then match `/start`, `/help`, `/report` one at a time.",
        "height": 150,
        "width": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "slack-webhook",
      "name": "Slack Events Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        460,
        380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "path": "slack-events",
        "httpMethod": "POST"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "extract-slack-fields",
      "name": "Extract Slack Message Fields",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        720,
        380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "user_id",
              "value": "={{ $json.event?.user }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "channel_id",
              "value": "={{ $json.event?.channel }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "message_text",
              "value": "={{ $json.event?.text }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "thread_ts",
              "value": "={{ $json.event?.ts }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "slack-intent-reply",
      "name": "Determine Intent & Draft Reply",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        980,
        380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "chat",
        "operation": "create",
        "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are a friendly, on-brand Slack support bot. Determine the user's intent and write a helpful reply in under 400 characters. Respond ONLY with strict JSON: {\"intent\": string, \"reply\": string}."
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "={{ $json.message_text }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.4,
          "maxTokens": 200
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "slack-post-reply",
      "name": "Post Threaded Reply",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1240,
        380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "channel": "={{ $('Extract Slack Message Fields').item.json.channel_id }}",
        "text": "={{ JSON.parse($json.choices[0].message.content).reply }}",
        "otherOptions": {
          "thread_ts": "={{ $('Extract Slack Message Fields').item.json.thread_ts }}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "log-slack-interaction",
      "name": "Log Slack Interaction",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.airtable",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1500,
        380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "create",
        "base": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "your_base_id",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "table": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Bot Interactions",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "Platform": "Slack",
            "User": "={{ $('Extract Slack Message Fields').item.json.user_id }}",
            "Message": "={{ $('Extract Slack Message Fields').item.json.message_text }}",
            "Response": "={{ JSON.parse($json.choices[0].message.content).reply }}",
            "Logged At": "={{ $now.toISO() }}"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "telegram-trigger",
      "name": "Telegram Bot Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegramTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        460,
        820
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "updates": [
          "message"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "is-command",
      "name": "Is Command Message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        720,
        820
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "is-command-c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ ($json.message?.text || '').startsWith('/') }}",
              "rightValue": "true",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "is-start",
      "name": "Is /start Command",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        980,
        700
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "is-start-c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ ($json.message?.text || '').split(' ')[0] }}",
              "rightValue": "/start",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "send-start-reply",
      "name": "Send Start Reply",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1240,
        620
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "sendMessage",
        "chatId": "={{ $json.message.chat.id }}",
        "text": "Welcome! I can respond to /start, /help, /report, or just send me a question."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "is-help",
      "name": "Is /help Command",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1240,
        780
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "is-help-c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ ($json.message?.text || '').split(' ')[0] }}",
              "rightValue": "/help",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "send-help-reply",
      "name": "Send Help Reply",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1500,
        700
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "sendMessage",
        "chatId": "={{ $json.message.chat.id }}",
        "text": "Commands:\n/start - welcome message\n/help - this message\n/report - get a status summary\nAnything else is treated as a free-text question."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "is-report",
      "name": "Is /report Command",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1500,
        860
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "is-report-c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ ($json.message?.text || '').split(' ')[0] }}",
              "rightValue": "/report",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "generate-status-report",
      "name": "Generate Status Report",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        1760,
        780
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "chat",
        "operation": "create",
        "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You generate a short (under 300 characters) status summary for a client who just asked for a report via a Telegram bot."
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "Generate today's status report summary."
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.3,
          "maxTokens": 150
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "send-report-reply",
      "name": "Send Report Reply",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        2020,
        780
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "sendMessage",
        "chatId": "={{ $('Telegram Bot Trigger').item.json.message.chat.id }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.choices[0].message.content }}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "send-unknown-reply",
      "name": "Send Unknown Command Reply",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1760,
        940
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "sendMessage",
        "chatId": "={{ $json.message.chat.id }}",
        "text": "Sorry, I don't recognize that command. Try /help to see what I can do."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "generate-freetext-reply",
      "name": "Generate Free-Text Reply",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        980,
        980
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "chat",
        "operation": "create",
        "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are a friendly Telegram support bot. Reply helpfully to the user's free-text message in under 400 characters."
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "={{ $json.message.text }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.4,
          "maxTokens": 200
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "send-freetext-reply",
      "name": "Send Free-Text Reply",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1240,
        980
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "sendMessage",
        "chatId": "={{ $('Telegram Bot Trigger').item.json.message.chat.id }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.choices[0].message.content }}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "log-telegram-interaction",
      "name": "Log Telegram Interaction",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.airtable",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        2280,
        900
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "create",
        "base": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "your_base_id",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "table": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Bot Interactions",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "Platform": "Telegram",
            "User": "={{ $('Telegram Bot Trigger').item.json.message.from.username }}",
            "Message": "={{ $('Telegram Bot Trigger').item.json.message.text }}",
            "Response": "={{ $json.text }}",
            "Logged At": "={{ $now.toISO() }}"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
